  :outcomes [
    "100% empirical ground truth restored with zero vacuous verification bypasses"
    "All 19 E2E test suites in tests/ verified green and integrated into Gate 5"
    "TaskRecord fully aligned with D52 enriched context and cybernetic effort/risk dimensions"
    "Safe multi-agent concurrency guaranteed by automated file-boundary collision prevention"
    "Autonomous agent self-healing enabled through closed refixing loops and RAM VFS discard"
    "Self-hosted pure ASL purity achieved through full eradication of monolithic Bash scripts"
  ]
  :consequences [
    (:pos "Completely closes the gap between declarative governance and physical disk reality")
    (:pos "Eliminates the risk of silent regressions by binding all integration tests to CI gates")
    (:pos "Ensures all autonomous agents operate with full context, preventing context evaporation")
    (:pos "Provides robust multi-agent concurrency without buffer overwrites or write races")
    (:neg "Requires maintaining and executing both unit and full E2E test suites during verification")
  ])
